# The windowed client: Heaps on HashLink.
#
# Heaps targets hl or js only — neither neko nor cpp can run it — so this is the
# one part of the Haxe client that needs a working `hl`. The netcode is verified
# independently by acceptance.hxml, which runs the same lab modules headless.
-main Main
-cp src
-cp ../../../../colyseus-haxe/src
-lib heaps
-lib hlsdl
-lib colyseus-websocket
-lib tink_http
-hl bin/playground.hl
